{{!
    @template enrol_apply/manage_actions

    The bulk action control of the applications queue, rendered into a core sticky footer.

    Only the action itself lives here. The decision's own inputs - the groups, the role, the
    message and the note - stay in the page body, because a core sticky footer is a fixed 80px
    bar whose .sticky-footer-content carries overflow hidden, so a textarea would be clipped.

    Both controls carry the toggle-all action vocabulary: data-action toggle, data-toggle action,
    and the group name, which core matches exactly rather than by prefix. Neither ships the
    disabled attribute, unlike core's own participants page: the queue is operable without
    JavaScript, so amd/src/manage.js disables them on init instead (see its docblock). That
    depends on the rule in styles.css that brings the sticky footer on screen when no script ran,
    because core parks one off screen until its own JavaScript slides it in.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * togglegroup string - name of the core/checkbox-toggleall group the table's rows belong to
    * selectedlabel string - the count of selected rows, worded "on this page" because that is
      what a selection is: refreshTableContent() replaces the whole table region on a page turn,
      a sort or a filter change, so every checkbox in it is destroyed and the count starts again
    * actionlabel string - label of the bulk action select
    * choosedots string - placeholder option of the bulk action select
    * golabel string - label of the submit button
    * actions array - list of value and label pairs, one per bulk action

    Example context (json):
    {
        "togglegroup": "enrol-apply-queue",
        "selectedlabel": "0 selected on this page",
        "actionlabel": "With selected users...",
        "choosedots": "Choose...",
        "golabel": "Go",
        "actions": [
            {"value": "confirm", "label": "Confirm requests"},
            {"value": "wait", "label": "Defer requests"},
            {"value": "cancel", "label": "Cancel requests"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-formaction d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
    <span class="enrol_apply-selectedcount small text-muted" data-region="selectedcount"
        aria-live="polite">{{selectedlabel}}</span>
    <label class="mb-0" for="enrol_apply_formaction">{{actionlabel}}</label>
    <select class="form-select w-auto" id="enrol_apply_formaction" name="formaction"
        data-action="toggle" data-toggle="action" data-togglegroup="{{togglegroup}}">
        <option value="">{{choosedots}}</option>
        {{#actions}}
            <option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>
        {{/actions}}
    </select>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"
        data-action="toggle" data-toggle="action" data-togglegroup="{{togglegroup}}">{{golabel}}</button>
</div>
